OL,3,GNEWSAIs battery power the future of the
OL,4,AUK's rail network?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA near #1bn investment will see the
OL,7,FUK's first battery-electric trains for
OL,8,Flong-distance main line services built
OL,9,Fin Derby, which Prime Minister Andy
OL,10,FBurnham has said will "bring faster,
OL,11,Fmore reliable journeys to the north".
OL,13,FThe new trains will replace diesel
OL,14,Fpower with electricity, and seek to cut
OL,15,Fjourney times by up to 10 minutes
OL,16,Fbetween Manchester and Leeds, and up to
OL,17,F14 minutes between Manchester and York.
OL,19,FSo are batteries set to drive forward a
OL,20,Fnew electric future of train travel in
OL,21,Fthe UK?
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
