OL,3,GNEWSAIs battery power the future of the
OL,4,AUK's rail network?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlstom UK product director James
OL,7,FO'Sullivan thinks so. He said the fleet
OL,8,Fwould be a "step change" for the
OL,9,Frailways.
